        "Content": "- BER A2 – A well-insulated, energy-efficient home with solar panels on the roof helping keep running costs down\r\n- Excellent transport links within easy reach of the property\r\n- Finished and maintained to a high standard\r\n- Large back garden to the rear and side (south westerly aspect) of the property\r\n- Suits all types of potential purchasers, first time mortgage approved, investors and those looking to trade up\r\n- Property has only ever been owner occupied and is 4 years old\r\n- Generously proportioned living areas and bedrooms\r\n- Abundance of natural light throughout the building\r\n- Possible to convert the attic into an additional room or living space\r\n- Parking for at least two cars to the front of the property"
